                      "fontSize": "8pt",
                      "color": "#1B1F27"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "Purview skills remain the operational truth, while confidence-gated records map to the 44 research-backed actions. Action count x customer or research minutes / 60 x labor rate x reinvestment x success/quality produces modeled value. The default Verified scope uses only direct classifications.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "8pt",
                      "color": "#1B1F27"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Inputs and projection: ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "8pt",
                      "color": "#1B1F27"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "Open Filters & cost to choose the billing model and enter PAYG, prepaid, or monthly commitment assumptions. Prepaid prices the purchased pool; Hybrid adds PAYG overage; Monthly Committed prices the commitment plus projected overage. Open Action assumptions to edit all 44 minute benchmarks and review research sources.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "8pt",
                      "color": "#1B1F27"
                    }
